*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "QL1100M.PPD"
*Product: "(Brother QL-1100 Label Print Server)"
*Manufacturer: "Brother"
*ModelName: "Brother QL-1100 Label Print Server"
*ShortNickName: "Brother QL-1100 Print Server"
*NickName: "Brother QL-1100 Label Print Server (macOS)"
*PSVersion: "(3010) 0"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42

*% The PPD for a Mac that prints to the Pi (install-macos-driver.sh installs
*% it). *Product is the name the Pi's queue advertises, which is how macOS
*% finds this file when the printer is added; it is not Brother's own product
*% name, so Brother's driver is not matched instead. The Mac passes the document through untouched; the Pi's own queue converts
*% and prints it. This file exists to put options in the macOS print dialog,
*% which a driverless (AirPrint) queue cannot show: the Mac sends them with
*% the job and brother-ql-autofit on the Pi acts on them.
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/pdf 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "image/jpeg image/jpeg 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "image/png image/png 0 -"

*% Sizes are named as brother-ql-autofit names its labels, so PageSize=62x100
*% selects that label on the Pi.
*OpenUI *PageSize/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: 102x152
*PageSize 102x152/102 x 152 mm (4 x 6 in): "<</PageSize[289 431]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 102x51/102 x 51 mm: "<</PageSize[289 145]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 62x100/62 x 100 mm: "<</PageSize[176 283]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 62x29/62 x 29 mm: "<</PageSize[176 82]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 29x90/29 x 90 mm: "<</PageSize[82 255]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 17x54/17 x 54 mm: "<</PageSize[48 153]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: 102x152
*PageRegion 102x152/102 x 152 mm (4 x 6 in): "<</PageRegion[289 431]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 102x51/102 x 51 mm: "<</PageRegion[289 145]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 62x100/62 x 100 mm: "<</PageRegion[176 283]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 62x29/62 x 29 mm: "<</PageRegion[176 82]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 29x90/29 x 90 mm: "<</PageRegion[82 255]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 17x54/17 x 54 mm: "<</PageRegion[48 153]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: 102x152
*ImageableArea 102x152/102 x 152 mm (4 x 6 in): "0 0 289 431"
*ImageableArea 102x51/102 x 51 mm: "0 0 289 145"
*ImageableArea 62x100/62 x 100 mm: "0 0 176 283"
*ImageableArea 62x29/62 x 29 mm: "0 0 176 82"
*ImageableArea 29x90/29 x 90 mm: "0 0 82 255"
*ImageableArea 17x54/17 x 54 mm: "0 0 48 153"

*DefaultPaperDimension: 102x152
*PaperDimension 102x152/102 x 152 mm (4 x 6 in): "289 431"
*PaperDimension 102x51/102 x 51 mm: "289 145"
*PaperDimension 62x100/62 x 100 mm: "176 283"
*PaperDimension 62x29/62 x 29 mm: "176 82"
*PaperDimension 29x90/29 x 90 mm: "82 255"
*PaperDimension 17x54/17 x 54 mm: "48 153"

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% -- Printer settings ------------------------------------------------
*% Generated by `brother-label-settings --model QL-1100 ppd-options`;
*% tests/test_print_server.py fails if this block and the package differ.
*OpenGroup: QLSettings/Stored Printer Settings
*OpenUI *QLAutoPowerOff/Auto power off (AC adapter): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLAutoPowerOff
*DefaultQLAutoPowerOff: NoChange
*QLAutoPowerOff NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLAutoPowerOff Never/Never: ""
*QLAutoPowerOff 1Hour/1 hour: ""
*QLAutoPowerOff 2Hours/2 hours: ""
*QLAutoPowerOff 4Hours/4 hours: ""
*QLAutoPowerOff 8Hours/8 hours: ""
*QLAutoPowerOff 12Hours/12 hours: ""
*CloseUI: *QLAutoPowerOff
*OpenUI *QLAutoPowerOn/Power on when plugged in: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLAutoPowerOn
*DefaultQLAutoPowerOn: NoChange
*QLAutoPowerOn NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLAutoPowerOn Off/Off: ""
*QLAutoPowerOn On/On: ""
*CloseUI: *QLAutoPowerOn
*OpenUI *QLCutMode/Cutter: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLCutMode
*DefaultQLCutMode: NoChange
*QLCutMode NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLCutMode Off/Off: ""
*QLCutMode CutAfterEachLabel/Cut after each label: ""
*QLCutMode CutAtEndOfJob/Cut at end of job: ""
*CloseUI: *QLCutMode
*OpenUI *QLPrintDataAfterPrinting/Print data after printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLPrintDataAfterPrinting
*DefaultQLPrintDataAfterPrinting: NoChange
*QLPrintDataAfterPrinting NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLPrintDataAfterPrinting Erase/Erase: ""
*QLPrintDataAfterPrinting Keep/Keep: ""
*CloseUI: *QLPrintDataAfterPrinting
*OpenUI *QLInfoReport/Information report contents: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLInfoReport
*DefaultQLInfoReport: NoChange
*QLInfoReport NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLInfoReport TransferredData/Transferred data: ""
*QLInfoReport PrinterSettings/Printer settings: ""
*QLInfoReport UsageLog/Usage log: ""
*QLInfoReport All/All: ""
*CloseUI: *QLInfoReport
*OpenUI *QLSerializeMode/Numbering after a job: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLSerializeMode
*DefaultQLSerializeMode: NoChange
*QLSerializeMode NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLSerializeMode ContinueFromLastNumber/Continue from last number: ""
*QLSerializeMode ResetToStartingNumber/Reset to starting number: ""
*CloseUI: *QLSerializeMode
*OpenUI *QLCommandMode/Command mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLCommandMode
*DefaultQLCommandMode: NoChange
*QLCommandMode NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLCommandMode Raster/Raster: ""
*QLCommandMode ESCP/ESC/P: ""
*QLCommandMode PTouchTemplate/P-touch Template: ""
*CloseUI: *QLCommandMode
*CloseGroup: QLSettings
